                "claim": "The isLowerHex condition mixes || and \u0026\u0026 with no parentheses and leans on operator precedence to express the 'a'..'f' and '0'..'9' ranges. It is correct today, but a later edit could easily break it without anyone noticing. Parenthesize the two ranges, or use a small helper, so the intent is explicit.",
