                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "VerifiedHandoff takes five consecutive string parameters (resultRef, resultSHA256, verdictRef, verdictSHA256) plus the outcome. Ref/SHA pairs can be swapped silently and the compiler will not catch it. Grouping each pair in a small struct would make call sites self-describing.",
                "proof_refs": [
